"""The first group of building kinds from the Cataclysm review, in the forms they took before the present day.

Cataclysm's own layouts (cddatypes.py) cover 1960 on. These are the older forms of the same kinds, each after a real
building kind in Moravia, drawn for WoDX in the same shape as eratypes.ERA_TYPES: hospitals (lazar house, general
hospital), the dead (charnel house, cemetery chapel), the law (town gaol, gendarmerie post), money (counting house,
savings bank), learning (monastery library, museum, public library), worship (synagogue), the rich (burgher palace),
night life (coffeehouse, dance hall), lodging (grand hotel), storage (granary, goods shed) and water (waterworks).
eras.py puts each up once, in the first era layer after its first year. Footprints in squares (1.5 m), front south.
"""
import buildings as B
import ddcore as C
import eratypes as E

